OL,3,GNEWSACompensation sought over
OL,4,A'redundant' port facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the UK's second-largest
OL,7,Fcross-Channel port has called for
OL,8,Fcompensation as a #23m facility could
OL,9,Fbe rendered unnecessary by a new UK-EU
OL,10,Fdeal.
OL,12,FPortsmouth City Council invested #6m
OL,13,Finto the Border Control Post (BCP) at
OL,14,FPortsmouth International Port in
OL,15,Fpreparation for post-Brexit rules on
OL,16,Ftrade.
OL,18,FPort director Mike Sellers said the
OL,19,Fcentre, which was built for 80 trailer
OL,20,Fchecks a day but had averaged two,
OL,21,Fwould not be needed if the draft deal
OL,22,Fcame into force.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
