OL,3,GNEWSACompensation sought over
OL,4,A'redundant' port facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it was building a
OL,7,F"close relationship" with the EU that
OL,8,Fwould strengthen the economy, protect
OL,9,FBritish industry, and create
OL,10,Fopportunities for young people, but did
OL,11,Fnot directly address calls for
OL,12,Fcompensation.
